"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 8 grids in Tipton County came in under 90% of normal in October to November in 37 of 75 years, the most of any pair. In 2025 the middle ran 188% of normal in April to May but 36% in November to December. In 2026 so far the middle sat at 49% in January to February and 51% in February to March. Every grid had its driest year in 1963, with grids 18760 and 18761 at 58%.</p>"}
